@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Diagram

[*] --> Off : Initial

state Off {
    [*] --> Off
}

state Active {
    [*] --> Active
}

state Ringing {
    [*] --> Ringing
}

Off --> Active : Set Alarm Time

Active --> Ringing : Current Time Matches Alarm Time

Ringing --> Off : Stop Alarm

Active --> Active : Next Scheduled Alarm Time

@enduml
